---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About us"
  description="Summit Heating & Air has kept Boulder-area homes comfortable since 2009 — licensed, local, and honest."
>
  <section class="py-[--spacing-section]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-balance sm:text-5xl">About Summit Heating & Air</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[52ch] text-lg text-text-muted">
        A family-owned HVAC company built on straight answers and work we're proud to sign our name to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-surface-alt py-[--spacing-section]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="Our story" heading="Sixteen years of Boulder winters and summers" />
      <Prose>
        <p>
          Summit Heating & Air started in 2009 with one truck, one technician, and a simple idea: tell
          people the truth about what their system needs, then do the work right the first time. Our
          founder spent a decade installing furnaces for a national chain before getting tired of
          quota-driven upsells and started Summit to do it differently.
        </p>
        <p>
          Boulder's climate doesn't make it easy — dry, triple-digit summer afternoons followed by
          winter nights well below freezing, all within a few months of each other. That range has
          shaped how we work. We size every system for the elevation and swings of the Front Range,
          not a generic spec sheet, and we stand behind every repair and install with a written
          workmanship warranty.
        </p>
        <h2>What hasn't changed</h2>
        <p>
          We're still locally owned, still licensed and insured in Boulder County, and still small
          enough that the person who answers your call knows the technician showing up at your door.
          Every estimate is free, every price is explained before we start, and we never charge for a
          diagnosis we can't fix on the same visit.
        </p>
        <h2>Where we're headed</h2>
        <p>
          Today our crew of certified technicians handles AC repair and installation, furnace and
          heat pump service, and indoor air quality systems for homes across the greater Boulder area.
          The truck count has grown, but the promise hasn't: honest quotes, no surprises, and comfort
          you can count on all year round.
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand heading="Ready to work with a crew you can trust?" ctaLabel="Get a quote" ctaHref="/contact" />
</Base>
